# Accessibility Baseline

## Required checks
- Maintain WCAG AA contrast (4.5:1 for body text and controls) on dark and light themes
- Ensure keyboard-only navigation works for major actions
- Add semantic labels/tooltips for icon-only controls and navigation actions
- Keep focus visible with 2px accent ring
- Provide route announcements and live regions for transient updates
- Respect reduced motion and text scaling; avoid mandatory animation

## UX safeguards
- Include skip-to-content on `web/index.html` shell
- Avoid color-only status indicators (combine icon + text)
- Keep empty/error states actionable
